        <p>MRS. HUBI-NEWCOMBE prepares Candidates for the Exams. of Associated Board of Royal Academy and Royal College of Music and of Trinity College (London). Her pupils in" SENIOR SINGING" have always taken highest marks at the local centres, one taking first Exhibition T.C.L. for United Kingdom. MRS. HUBI-NEWCOMBE PROVIDES CONCERT PARTIES. __</p>
