        <p>INCOME TAX. ARE YOU OVER-ASSESSED? If so, forward Notice of Assessment and any other Tax Papers to JOSEPH DIXON, F.A.A. INCOME TAX SPECIALIST, 18, MARSDEN STREET, WIGAN. Over 20 years' Official Practical Experience nf Taxes in the Offices of Assessors, Collectors, and Surveyors of Taxes.</p>
